#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:1
msgid "怪物设定"
msgstr "Monster Settings"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:4
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;该文档描述怪物设定的文案主要用于提供编剧的想法以及作为美术创作的参考。可在后续创作中根据需要再调整和改变怪物设定。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;The monster setting descriptions in this document are "
"primarily intended to provide ideas for writers and serve as reference "
"for art creation. Monster settings can be adjusted and changed as needed "
"in subsequent creative work."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:7
msgid "一、怪物世界的背景"
msgstr "1. Background of the Monster World"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:9
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;太阳加速进入红巨星期，开始发出异常的太阳辐射和发生更加频繁的太阳风暴现象。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;同时在强烈太阳风暴的冲击下，地球的地轴倾角变得越来越大，地球变得几乎是躺倒在绕太阳公转的轨道上。有更多的地区进入了极昼或是极夜的自然状态中。"
"   &emsp;&emsp;但在自然选择的作用下，这样的世界却变成了一些生命力极强适应下来的变异动植物们的乐园。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;过去的地球，形成了遗弃城市、废弃工厂、极夜冰封之城、废弃的地下铁建筑、仅存的世外桃源等。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;曾经人类的家园，除了1%的局部地区之外，全都被动物类的妖兽和具备攻击力的植物占领。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;由于遭到不同（α、β、γ）射线辐射，部分动植物残留的远祖基因被激活，从而一步步返祖进化成了变异怪兽和变异植物，且带有不同的变异后特征。"
"   &emsp;&emsp;曾经远古存在的动植物，再次降临世界！   "
"&emsp;&emsp;β射线还意外导致地球上，原本由人类制造的人工智能产品，产生拟人化状态，形成人格，并且有了“族群感”。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;β射线造成的拟人化机械体，尽力模仿成为人类的样子，并且认为目前地表世界，应该由他们统治。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;γ射线造成机械的智能化变异，产生机器怪物。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;The Sun accelerated into its red giant phase, beginning to "
"emit abnormal solar radiation and experiencing more frequent solar "
"storms.   &emsp;&emsp;At the same time, under the impact of intense solar"
" storms, the Earth's axial tilt became increasingly larger, causing the "
"Earth to lie almost flat on its orbital path around the Sun. More regions"
" entered a natural state of perpetual day or perpetual night.   "
"&emsp;&emsp;However, through natural selection, this world became a "
"paradise for some mutant flora and fauna with extremely strong vitality "
"that managed to adapt.   &emsp;&emsp;The former Earth gave rise to "
"abandoned cities, abandoned factories, polar night frozen cities, "
"abandoned underground metro structures, and the last remaining paradise."
"   &emsp;&emsp;What was once humanity's home, except for 1% of local "
"areas, has been entirely occupied by animal-type demonic beasts and "
"aggressive plants.   &emsp;&emsp;Due to exposure to different (α, β, γ) "
"radiation, some residual ancestral genes in animals and plants were "
"activated, gradually causing atavistic evolution into mutant monsters and"
" mutant plants, each with different post-mutation characteristics.   "
"&emsp;&emsp;Ancient animals and plants that once existed long ago have "
"descended upon the world once more!   &emsp;&emsp;β radiation also "
"unexpectedly caused AI products originally manufactured by humans on "
"Earth to develop anthropomorphic states, forming personalities and "
"gaining a sense of \"tribal identity.\"   &emsp;&emsp;The anthropomorphic"
" mechanical entities created by β radiation strive to imitate human "
"appearance and believe that the current surface world should be ruled by "
"them.   &emsp;&emsp;γ radiation caused intelligent mutations in "
"machinery, producing machine monsters."

