#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:3
msgid "部分羊、老虎、受到此世界的β射线辐射，激活体内残留的饕餮基因，返祖进化，并且因为射线导致半机械化的形态。"
msgstr ""
"Partially sheep, tiger. Exposed to β radiation in this world, activating "
"residual Taotie genes in their bodies, atavistically evolving, and "
"becoming semi-mechanical in form due to the radiation."

