#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:3
msgid "羊的身体形态，人类的五官面庞，头顶羊角，露出两个月牙型的獠牙、尾巴上有一个金属的攻击性武器，看起来萌萌的。肩膀上扛着一个打补丁的袋子。"
msgstr ""
"Sheep-like body with human facial features, sheep horns on top of the "
"head, two crescent-shaped fangs visible, a metallic offensive weapon on "
"its tail, looking quite cute. Carries a patched sack over its shoulder."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:3
#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:37
#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:55
#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:73
