#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:126
#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:143
#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:162
msgid "性格特征"
msgstr "Personality Traits"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:3
msgid "贪心，欲望强烈，喜欢亮晶晶的东西，并有收集癖，可以在打的时候掉落一些宝石类道具，常常误以为对方要抢夺自己收集的宝物而主动攻击。"
msgstr ""
"Greedy with strong desires. Loves shiny things and has a hoarding "
"compulsion. Can drop gem-type items when defeated. Often mistakenly "
"believes others are trying to steal its collected treasures and initiates"
" attacks."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:3
#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:37
#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:55
#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:73
#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:91
#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:109
#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:126
#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:143
#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:162
msgid "剧本设定"
msgstr "Story Setting"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:3
msgid "受到β射线影响，由隐藏着饕餮基因的动物返祖进化出现，因为射线基因遭到改造，部分细胞金属化，但原本凶残暴虐的原生性格也遭到破坏，甚至成为了草食动物。饕餮从出生后，便开始以植物为食，它们只有一个目的，收集和抢夺亮晶晶的东西，所有战斗都是因收集癖而开展，也会担心宝物遭觊觎主动出击，攻击状态下显得暴躁，从毛发可以表现出来。"
msgstr ""
"Influenced by β radiation, animals with hidden Taotie genes emerged "
"through atavistic evolution. Due to radiation altering their genes, some "
"cells became metallic, but their originally fierce and brutal nature was "
"also disrupted — they even became herbivores. After birth, Taotie began "
"feeding on plants. They have only one purpose: to collect and seize shiny"
" things. All battles are driven by their hoarding compulsion. They also "
"proactively attack out of fear that their treasures may be coveted, "
"appearing aggressive when in attack mode, which is visible through their "
"fur."

