#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:39
msgid "山魈王"
msgstr "Mandrill King"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:37
msgid "40—60"
msgstr "40–60"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:37
msgid "在少量人类聚集前山谷中生存的动物（人类故意放他们在那抵御外来侵略）。曾经是某动物园猴山里的猴子，受到某段β基因辐射，远祖山魈基因被激活。"
msgstr ""
"Animals surviving in valleys near small human settlements (humans "
"intentionally placed them there to defend against external invasions). "
"Formerly monkeys from a zoo's monkey mountain, exposed to β gene "
"radiation, their ancestral mandrill genes were activated."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:37
msgid "脸庞像人类但保留山魈的特征，看起来古怪又恐怖，上肢较长且十分健壮，大小臂背面覆盖有似乎是变异并金属化的延伸出的骨骼结构。穿着不知道哪里弄来的破旧的人类衣物（从剧场捡来的齐天大圣孙悟空的戏服，披风上有“齐天大圣”的字样），带着耳机。"
msgstr ""
"Face resembles a human but retains mandrill features, looking bizarre and"
" terrifying. The upper limbs are long and very muscular, with the backs "
"of both upper and lower arms covered in what appears to be mutated and "
"metallicized extended bone structures. Wearing tattered human clothing of"
" unknown origin (a stage costume of the Monkey King Sun Wukong picked up "
"from a theater, with the words \"Great Sage Equal to Heaven\" on the "
"cape), and wearing headphones."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:37
msgid "愤怒、暴躁。"
msgstr "Angry, irritable."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:37
msgid "遭到辐射变异后最强的山魈，带领其他猴子离开动物园，智力和寿命得到极大提升，身高达到200公分以上，能长时间直立行走。夜晚时，因为面相可怕，脸上又有自身合成的荧光物质聚集，常常被误认为是鬼魂。猴子们生活在世外桃源前面的一座山谷，自己制造了一座树藤编织的桥，山魈王是它们的首领。因为智力提升之后，常常怀念曾经在动物园中有人喂养伺候的慵懒时光，反而幻想曾经人类都是自己的奴隶，竟因此生出了思念故乡“动物园”的情绪。"
msgstr ""
"The strongest mandrill after radiation mutation, leading other monkeys to"
" leave the zoo. Intelligence and lifespan were greatly enhanced, height "
"reached over 200 cm, and capable of walking upright for extended periods."
" At night, due to its terrifying face and the fluorescent substances "
"synthesized on its face, it is often mistaken for a ghost. The monkeys "
"live in a valley in front of the paradise, having built a bridge woven "
"from tree vines themselves, with the Mandrill King as their leader. After"
" gaining intelligence, it often nostalgically remembers the lazy days in "
"the zoo when it was fed and served, instead fantasizing that humans were "
"once its slaves, and unexpectedly developed feelings of homesickness for "
"its \"hometown\" — the zoo."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:37
msgid "迅速偷袭、搬起石头或其他地图上的道具砸人、刀锋一样的利爪横着旋转窜前攻击。"
msgstr ""
"Swift sneak attacks, lifting stones or other map props to smash enemies, "
"razor-sharp claws spinning forward in a lateral rotation attack."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:37
msgid "愤怒"
msgstr "Wrath"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:37
msgid "思君（想奴役人类）若汶水，浩荡寄南征。"
msgstr ""
"Yearning for you (wanting to enslave humans) like the Wen River, vast and"
" boundless, sent on a southern campaign."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:37
msgid "世外桃源小镇，一座树藤搭建的桥"
msgstr "Paradise Town, a bridge built from tree vines"

