#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:55
msgid "18-25"
msgstr "18–25"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:55
msgid "受到β射线激活远祖九尾狐基因造成变异，且带有拟人化特征（Furry），且极力的装扮成人类的样子。"
msgstr ""
"Mutated by β radiation activating ancestral Nine-Tailed Fox genes, with "
"anthropomorphic features (Furry), striving hard to dress up and appear "
"human."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:55
msgid "有类似人类世俗眼光下美女的精致五官和妆容，有着一双媚眼。虽然留着长发，想要掩盖尖长的耳朵，但是还是有部分带白色绒毛的耳朵会露出来。受到废弃城市中的人类宣传海报影响，学会了给自己穿搭露腰露腿的长裙，掩盖住尾巴，维持着婀娜的体态。身上散发着一种异常的荷尔蒙气味，为了不被发现，甘愿居住在城市下水道或是废弃地铁线路中。"
msgstr ""
"Has delicate facial features and makeup like those of a beauty in "
"conventional human eyes, with a pair of seductive eyes. Although keeping "
"long hair to cover pointed ears, some white-furred ears still show. "
"Influenced by human advertising posters in abandoned cities, learned to "
"wear long dresses that expose the waist and legs, covering the tail and "
"maintaining a graceful figure. Emits an abnormal pheromone scent. To "
"avoid detection, willingly lives in city sewers or abandoned metro lines."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:55
msgid "和有智能的生物沟通时喜欢假装柔弱，并在通常状态下隐藏自己的攻击性，但实际凶狠起来破坏力极强。不会在任何人面前露出自己不堪的一面，包括猎杀食物，吃东西时的血腥场景。有人性的觉醒后，幻想并希望自己成为像人类明星那样被宠爱的存在。"
msgstr ""
"When communicating with intelligent beings, likes to pretend to be weak "
"and usually hides its aggressive nature, but is actually extremely "
"destructive when provoked. Never shows its unsightly side to anyone, "
"including the bloody scenes of hunting and eating food. After awakening "
"to humanity, fantasizes and hopes to become a beloved existence like a "
"human celebrity."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:55
msgid "由狐狸变异而来，沉迷于自己的长相，并引以为傲，但又嫉妒任何被认为和自己美貌不相伯仲的事物，比如地表的花妖。为了保持美丽，掩盖气息不被危险的生物发现。喜欢血腥的味道和食物。居住在地下世界，带着一群未能变异成功的小狐狸，常常用“美人计”示弱并引诱其他异兽中设下的圈套，然后杀死带回基地分食。"
msgstr ""
"Mutated from a fox. Obsessed with and proud of its appearance, yet "
"jealous of anything considered equally beautiful, such as the Flower "
"Demon on the surface. To maintain its beauty, it conceals its scent to "
"avoid detection by dangerous creatures. Enjoys the taste and food of "
"blood. Lives in the underground world with a group of small foxes that "
"failed to mutate successfully. Often uses the \"beauty trap\" to feign "
"weakness and lure other mutant beasts into traps, then kills them and "
"brings them back to the base to share as food."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:55
msgid "伸出九只尾巴舞动，散播荷尔蒙物质，使男性角色魅惑、女性角色产生异常的厌恶感而停止攻击；指尖伸出利爪攻击；召唤小狐狸群围攻。"
msgstr ""
"Extends and dances its nine tails, spreading pheromone substances that "
"charm male characters and cause female characters to feel abnormal "
"disgust, stopping their attacks; extends sharp claws from fingertips to "
"attack; summons packs of small foxes for swarm attacks."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:55
msgid "傲慢、嫉妒"
msgstr "Pride, Envy"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:55
msgid "不顾自身强求变，只能贻笑数千年！"
msgstr ""
"Forcing change beyond one's nature only invites ridicule for thousands of"
" years!"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:55
msgid "废弃城市、地下铁"
msgstr "Abandoned City, Underground Metro"

