msgid "九尾狐（Q版）"
msgstr "Nine-Tailed Fox (Chibi)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:75
msgid "花妖"
msgstr "Flower Demon"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:73
msgid "28-32（成熟知性，御姐型）"
msgstr "28–32 (Mature and intellectual, onee-san type)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:73
msgid "受到β射线辐射的远古彼岸花，花朵中的雌蕊拟态成为了人形的妖艳美女形象。"
msgstr ""
"An ancient Red Spider Lily exposed to β radiation, where the pistil in "
"the flower mimicked and transformed into a seductive beauty in human "
"form."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:73
msgid "看起来妖艳漂亮，以树叶作为遮挡上半身的衣物，下肢没有形成腿脚而是成为类似人鱼下半身的形状，在最下面通过几根粗壮树根变成可动的触角形态来进行移动，下肢由花瓣和雄蕊形成带饰物的裙摆形状，手的小臂部分还是树杈。遮挡身体的衣物由宽大柔软的树叶做成，可以用鲜花点缀，头发也可以是像头发的植物。身体上可以有合适的部位长出一朵带有茎叶伪花。花妖会通过改变身体外表皮组织上细微的物理结构，控制对光线的反射效果，最终产生艳丽的色彩变幻。在昏暗的环境里，或是单一光谱的光源下，会发现花妖全身只会呈现出暗淡的灰白色彩。"
msgstr ""
"Appears seductively beautiful. Uses leaves as clothing to cover the upper"
" body. The lower body has not formed legs and feet but instead takes on a"
" mermaid-like lower body shape. At the very bottom, several thick tree "
"roots transform into movable tentacle-like forms for locomotion. The "
"lower body is formed by petals and stamens into a skirt-like shape with "
"ornaments. The forearms remain as tree branches. The clothing covering "
"the body is made from large, soft leaves that can be decorated with fresh"
" flowers. The hair can also be plant-like hair. An appropriate part of "
"the body may grow a pseudo-flower with stem and leaves. The Flower Demon "
"can control light reflection effects by altering the fine physical "
"structure of its outer skin tissue, ultimately producing gorgeous color "
"transformations. In dim environments or under single-spectrum light "
"sources, the Flower Demon's entire body will only appear in dull grayish-"
"white colors."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:73
msgid "极力向外展现自己的妖艳成熟，一举一动呈现出十足的魅惑，但也可以随时收起所有的美感，成为冷艳杀手。（在与智慧生物沟通时仿佛有着成熟女人的知性体贴和大姐姐般的果敢决然）。"
msgstr ""
"Desperately displays its seductive maturity outward, with every movement "
"exuding full charm, but can also withdraw all beauty at any moment to "
"become a cold and alluring killer. (When communicating with intelligent "
"beings, it seems to possess the intellectual thoughtfulness of a mature "
"woman and the decisive resolve of a big sister.)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:73
msgid "剧本设定：远古彼岸花经过射线辐射变异而成，生存在热带雨林式的巨大植物环境当中，浑身散发着妩媚和欲望的气息。人性和自然性交织，知道自己是稀有的变异而成的智慧生物，但特别沮丧于同类稀少且无法繁衍的事实。为了欲望而活，捕捉猎物，在猎物被迷惑后，不会让他们立刻死去，而是慢慢折磨。因为担心衰老和生命力消褪，只想在有活力的时候纵情挥霍，把每一天都活成自己的末日。"
msgstr ""
"Story setting: An ancient Red Spider Lily mutated through radiation, "
"living in a tropical rainforest-like environment of giant plants, "
"emanating an aura of charm and desire from its entire body. Humanity and "
"nature intertwined. Knows it is a rare mutated intelligent being, but is "
"particularly frustrated by the fact that its kind is scarce and unable to"
" reproduce. Lives for desire, capturing prey. After prey is enchanted, it"
" does not let them die immediately but slowly tortures them. Because it "
"worries about aging and the fading of its vitality, it only wants to "
"indulge extravagantly while still energetic, living every day as if it "
"were its last."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:73
msgid "双手树杈生长，网状，将敌人包裹住拉近攻击。召唤食人花，进行群攻。裙底的藤蔓生长攻击。被动技能：魅惑，在日光下反射出奇异的光彩，让观者产生异常的情绪波动。"
msgstr ""
"Tree branch hands grow into a net-like structure, wrapping around enemies"
" and pulling them close for attack. Summons Venus flytraps for swarm "
"attacks. Vine growth attacks from under the skirt. Passive skill: Charm —"
" reflects strange and wondrous colors under sunlight, causing viewers to "
"experience abnormal emotional fluctuations."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:73
msgid "淫欲"
msgstr "Lust"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:73
msgid "桃之夭夭，灼灼其华。今朝有酒今朝醉，明日愁来明日愁。"
msgstr ""
"The peach tree blossoms brilliantly, its flowers radiant. Enjoy today's "
"wine today; let tomorrow's worries wait for tomorrow."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:73
msgid "遗弃城市的森林场景"
msgstr "Abandoned City Forest Scene"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:73
