#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:93
msgid "英招"
msgstr "Yingzhao"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:91
msgid "28"
msgstr "28"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:91
msgid "老虎、马，受到β射线影响激活了潜在的基因进化而成。"
msgstr "Tiger, horse. Evolved after β radiation activated their latent genes."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:91
msgid "类似人马兽的样子，【马身】上皮肤是老虎的皮肤，发型飘逸，尾巴赤红，两只手可以拿着斧头或者锤形等兵器，【人身】上肌肉健美感十足（黑色，金属感），任何姿态都具有美感。"
msgstr ""
"Resembles a centaur. The [horse body] has tiger skin, flowing hair style,"
" crimson tail. Both hands can hold weapons such as axes or hammers. The "
"[human body] has a very muscular and aesthetic build (black, metallic "
"feel), with beauty in every posture."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:91
msgid "高傲，追求完美，睥睨天下，自认为样貌和力量无人能及，有老虎的王者气质和骏马的潇洒气质。"
msgstr ""
"Arrogant, pursuing perfection, looking down upon the world. Believes its "
"appearance and power are unmatched. Possesses the regal aura of a tiger "
"and the graceful spirit of a fine steed."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:91
msgid "受到β射线进化而成，有天然让百兽臣服的属性，可以召唤小型怪兽战斗，看不起任何末日时代下的生物，在十足的傲气之下，显得孤独。在这个人类末日的时代，英招的生存意义就是不断追求自身的完美，常常因为对其他生物露出鄙夷的神色，引发斗争。"
msgstr ""
"Evolved through β radiation. Has a natural attribute that makes all "
"beasts submit. Can summon small monsters for battle. Looks down on any "
"creature in the apocalyptic era. Beneath its full arrogance lies "
"loneliness. In this era of human apocalypse, Yingzhao's purpose in life "
"is to continuously pursue its own perfection. Often provokes fights by "
"showing contemptuous expressions toward other creatures."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:91
msgid "手持武器冲锋攻击。铁蹄踩踏攻击。召唤手下群攻。"
msgstr ""
"Charging attacks with held weapons. Iron hoof stomping attacks. Summons "
"subordinates for swarm attacks."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:91
#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:143
msgid "傲慢"
msgstr "Pride"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:91
msgid "满招损，谦受益。"
msgstr "Complacency brings loss; humility brings benefit."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:91
msgid "冰封城市"
msgstr "Frozen City"

