#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:111
msgid "穷奇"
msgstr "Qiongqi"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:109
msgid "100"
msgstr "100"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:109
msgid "野狼受到β射线，激活远祖基因进化而成的飞行兽。"
msgstr ""
"Wild wolves exposed to β radiation, with activated ancestral genes "
"evolving into flying beasts."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:109
msgid "健壮的狼身，加翅膀，可以穿上金色的盔甲（毛发皮肤变异而成的有机械结构感的金属盔甲），脑门中间有长而霸气的鬃毛，除了盔甲部分，其余露出的部分可以做成血红色，有獠牙。"
msgstr ""
"Robust wolf body with wings. Can wear golden armor (hair and skin mutated"
" into metallic armor with a mechanical structural feel). Has long and "
"imposing mane in the middle of its forehead. Apart from the armored "
"parts, the exposed areas can be blood red, with fangs."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:109
msgid "嫉妒、凶残。"
msgstr "Jealous, ferocious."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:109
msgid "群居的野狼变异后，更加强大，认为自己是秩序的维持者，经常成群结队的参与进其他妖兽间的战斗。可往往会欺负有理的一方，助纣为虐，喜欢看到他人犯下恶行。牠们认为，生存的意义和目标，就是把这个支离破碎的世界，疯狂破坏成一片废墟。"
msgstr ""
"After pack-dwelling wild wolves mutated, they became even more powerful. "
"They consider themselves maintainers of order and frequently join battles"
" between other demonic beasts in packs. However, they tend to bully the "
"righteous side and aid the wicked, enjoying seeing others commit evil "
"deeds. They believe that the meaning and goal of survival is to wildly "
"destroy this already shattered world into complete ruins."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:109
msgid "飞行，速度极快的居高临下，张大嘴撕咬敌人。煽动翅膀，制造小型龙卷风攻击。仰头吼叫，率领族群冲撞撕咬群攻。"
msgstr ""
"Flight, extremely fast diving attacks from above, biting enemies with "
"wide-open jaws. Flaps wings to create small tornado attacks. Throws head "
"back to howl, leading the pack in charging and biting swarm attacks."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:109
msgid "嫉妒（嫉妒一切比自己好的人事物，看到好的东西就要毁灭，惩善扬恶）"
msgstr ""
"Envy (jealous of all people and things better than itself, destroying "
"anything good it sees, punishing the good and promoting the wicked)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:109
msgid "善者沮服恶人起（善良的人受到挫败，恶人成为世界主导）"
msgstr ""
"The good are crushed while the wicked rise (righteous people suffer "
"defeat, and the wicked become the dominant force in the world)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:109
msgid "地铁，冰封城市"
msgstr "Metro, Frozen City"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:109
#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:125
msgid "小穷奇"
msgstr "Small Qiongqi"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:109
msgid ""
"<img src=\"/img/monster/xiaoqiongqi.png\" alt=\"小穷奇\" "
"width=\"300px\"><p>画师：软糖工作室</p>"
msgstr ""
"<img src=\"/img/monster/xiaoqiongqi.png\" alt=\"Small Qiongqi\" "
"width=\"300px\"><p>Artist: Gummy Studio</p>"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:125
#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:126
msgid "大穷奇"
msgstr "Large Qiongqi"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:125
msgid ""
"<img src=\"/img/monster/daqiongqi.png\" alt=\"大穷奇\" "
"width=\"500px\"><p>画师：软糖工作室</p>"
msgstr ""
"<img src=\"/img/monster/daqiongqi.png\" alt=\"Large Qiongqi\" "
"width=\"500px\"><p>Artist: Gummy Studio</p>"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:128
msgid "貔貅"
msgstr "Pixiu"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:126
msgid "40"
msgstr "40"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:126
msgid "熊猫受到β射线辐射，激活了远祖的貔貅基因（传说熊猫是貔貅的原型）。"
msgstr ""
"Giant pandas exposed to β radiation, activating ancestral Pixiu genes "
"(legend says pandas were the prototype for Pixiu)."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:126
msgid "用两足站立，有很大的肚腩，毛茸茸的，身上是类似熊猫的黑白色。"
msgstr ""
"Stands on two legs, has a large belly, is furry, with black and white "
"coloring similar to a panda."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:126
msgid "有着懒散的肚腩，一切东西都想吃，发生变异后。牙齿成为了坚硬的金属，会以一切有机物矿物金属的物质缓慢地进食。"
msgstr ""
"Has a lazy belly and wants to eat everything. After mutation, its teeth "
"became hard metal, and it will slowly feed on all organic, mineral, and "
"metallic substances."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:126
msgid "认为一切东西都是可以吃的，看到想吃的东西就会不顾一切的去获取，食用，胃功能也十分强大，吃下去的任何物件都会被胃袋贮存和消化。生存的意义和目标，就是不断吃想吃的东西，除了吃东西和觅食，平时只想躺下一动也不动。"
msgstr ""
"Believes everything is edible. When it sees something it wants to eat, it"
" will stop at nothing to obtain and consume it. Its digestive function is"
" also very powerful — any object swallowed will be stored and digested by"
" its stomach pouch. Its meaning and goal in life is to continuously eat "
"what it desires. Aside from eating and foraging, it only wants to lie "
"down motionless."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:126
msgid "翻滚，依靠体重对敌人造成伤害。深吸一口气，肚子变得更鼓，然后吐出一些乱七八糟的东西（什么都可以有，废弃世界的垃圾或是珍宝道具）生气时会张开以血盆大口进行吞噬。躺下装死，使伤害无效化并回复生命。"
msgstr ""
"Rolling, using its body weight to inflict damage on enemies. Takes a deep"
" breath, its belly becoming even more distended, then spits out random "
"objects (anything is possible — junk from the abandoned world or treasure"
" items). When angry, opens its massive jaws to swallow enemies whole. "
"Lies down and plays dead, nullifying damage and recovering health."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:126
msgid "暴食"
msgstr "Gluttony"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:126
msgid "吾少贫贱真臞儒,贪食嗜味老不除。"
msgstr ""
"In my youth I was poor and thin; my gluttony and taste for flavor remain "
"unshaken in old age."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:126
msgid "废弃城市、废弃工厂、冰封城市"
msgstr "Abandoned City, Abandoned Factory, Frozen City"

