#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:145
msgid "赛博幽魂"
msgstr "Cyber Ghost"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:143
#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:162
msgid "不详"
msgstr "Unknown"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:143
msgid "原本只是一段电脑程序，有一天运行这段程序的电子设备受到了γ射线的辐射，多个逻辑门电位同时翻转却刚好使得程序以另一套指令正常地运行。但是功能却变成了会自我传播复制的电脑病毒。随着电子设备上持续接受辐射影响，病毒程序进化出了自我意识，开始试图感染和控制一切有芯片结构的机械或电路元件，并寻找自己存在的意义。"
msgstr ""
"Originally just a computer program. One day, the electronic device "
"running this program was exposed to γ radiation, causing multiple logic "
"gate potentials to simultaneously flip, which coincidentally made the "
"program run normally with a different set of instructions. However, its "
"function transformed into a self-propagating and self-replicating "
"computer virus. As the electronic devices continued to receive radiation,"
" the virus program evolved self-awareness and began attempting to infect "
"and control all mechanical or circuit components with chip structures, "
"while searching for the meaning of its own existence."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:143
msgid "无实体的结构，只会在被感染的带有显示屏或投影功能的电子设备上投射出一个具有科幻感立体的悬浮的机械骷髅头的图案。初始形象是一台普通的笔记本电脑，从带三维立体投影功能的摄像头上投射出霓虹色的机械骷髅（就仿佛像是从阿拉丁神灯口中漂浮出灯神的概念一般）。"
msgstr ""
"Has no physical structure. Only projects a sci-fi-styled three-"
"dimensional floating mechanical skull pattern on infected electronic "
"devices with displays or projection capabilities. Its initial form is an "
"ordinary laptop, projecting a neon-colored mechanical skull from a camera"
" with 3D holographic projection capability (like the concept of a genie "
"floating out of Aladdin's lamp)."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:143
msgid "觉得自己超级聪明，无所不能，认为自己本质是没有实体的不朽地存在，所以应该掌控一切成为世界主宰。"
msgstr ""
"Believes it is super intelligent and omnipotent. Considers itself an "
"immortal, non-corporeal entity that should control everything and become "
"the ruler of the world."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:143
msgid "在不断变异和自己升级的过程中储存了海量数据，加上变异后感染了运算能力数十倍提高的智能设备，开始认为自己无论是反应速度还是分析能力都远超过人类和任何妖兽。在对战过程中，电脑怪物经过分析后，能预判对手行为，以及生成应对预案。虽然攻击力没有某些妖兽强大，但因为过于智能，常常将某些具有机械结构的变异生物的行为纳入自己的掌控之中。最终找到自己生存的意义和目标：掌控一切智慧生物，再造新世界。"
msgstr ""
"During continuous mutation and self-upgrading, it stored massive amounts "
"of data. Combined with infecting intelligent devices with dozens of times"
" more computing power after mutation, it began to believe that its "
"reaction speed and analytical abilities far surpassed humans and any "
"demonic beast. During battles, the computer monster can predict opponent "
"behavior through analysis and generate response plans. Although its "
"attack power is not as strong as some demonic beasts, due to its "
"excessive intelligence, it often brings the behavior of certain mutant "
"creatures with mechanical structures under its control. Ultimately, it "
"found its meaning and goal in life: to control all intelligent beings and"
" forge a new world."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:143
msgid "感染智能武器，使玩家角色互相攻击。感染有机械结构的变异生物，增强其进攻性，或是帮助其提高战斗的智能。感染并附身于危险的机械装置或是机器人，使其主动攻击人类。"
msgstr ""
"Infects smart weapons, causing player characters to attack each other. "
"Infects mutant creatures with mechanical structures, enhancing their "
"aggressiveness or helping them improve their combat intelligence. Infects"
" and possesses dangerous mechanical devices or robots, making them "
"actively attack humans."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:143
msgid "不畏浮云遮望眼，自缘身在最高层。"
msgstr ""
"Fear not the floating clouds that block the view, for I stand at the "
"highest level."

