#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:164
msgid "电气怪物"
msgstr "Electric Monster"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:162
msgid "一种常被赛博幽魂病毒寄宿的机械装置，是一个力量型的工业机器人型怪物。"
msgstr ""
"A mechanical device commonly inhabited by the Cyber Ghost virus. It is a "
"power-type industrial robot monster."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:162
msgid "冷静，没有感情，智能+暴力"
msgstr "Calm, emotionless, intelligent + brute force"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:162
msgid "赛博幽魂出场的环境中，通过控制的工厂机械臂加工附近废弃机械装置以及车间生产的摩托和小汽车等，组合形成的怪物。"
msgstr ""
"In environments where Cyber Ghosts appear, monsters formed by combining "
"nearby abandoned mechanical devices processed through controlled factory "
"robotic arms, along with motorcycles and cars produced in workshops."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:162
msgid "超强的物理打击能力，以及加特林式的武器"
msgstr "Superhuman physical striking ability, along with Gatling-style weapons"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/setting/monster.md:162
msgid "毁灭世界，清楚所有生物痕迹，创立新秩序"
msgstr ""
"Destroy the world, eliminate all traces of living beings, and establish a"
" new order"

